  "notes": "Header labels: GPIO names from the pink callouts; functions list the board silkscreen spelling first (IO16 etc.), then the grey box number and other callouts read outward from the pin. TXD/RXD pins: callout GPIO43/GPIO44 used as label, TXD/RXD (box and silkscreen) in functions. QwiiC labels from the board silkscreen beside the connector (GND 3.3V IO43 IO44 left to right). LoRa module, E-Paper and TF card tables are internal; battery JST (2.0mm) skipped.",
